screen 1280 800 dpi 1.0
# U42: config sets (the popup coordinates are for 1280x800; e_sets_1920x1080 is the same script
# for the other resolution). "Manage..." (OpenConfigSetManagePopup: ConfigSetListControl + Done):
# * New: NewConfigSet, the "Set Name" popup (RenameSet with addOnName), type a name, Save
#   (title, modFlag, the row appended and selected, AddUndoState, SyncLoadouts); RETURN would
#   not reach the popup's enter control: the focused edit consumes it (EditControl.lua:513);
# * select row 1 and F2 (OnSelKeyDown: the "Rename" popup), append "X", Save;
# * Copy row 1 (copyTable of the set under the first free id, RenameSet with addOnName);
# * double-click row 2 (OnSelClick: SetActiveConfigSet(2), AddUndoState): "(Current)" moves;
# * Delete row 2 (OnSelDelete: the confirm popup, RETURN: the set removed, the active set falls
#   back to the row above, AddUndoState, SyncLoadouts);
# * Done; then the "Config set:" dropdown (enabled with more than one set) picks the copy
#   (SetActiveConfigSet through BuildHooks, AddUndoState).
#! u42-expect-config id="3" title="DefaultXC"
#! u42-expect-config activeConfigSet="3"
fixture userdir=../../fixtures/user1
